URL: https://drj001.github.io/wgAim/, https://github.com/DrJ001/wgAim
BugReports: https://github.com/DrJ001/wgAim/issues
Description: A unified whole-genome analysis toolkit for plant breeding
    populations, built around the ASReml-R linear mixed modelling engine.
    Provides three integrated analysis pillars: QTL detection in biparental
    mapping populations (qtlAim), genome-wide association analysis in
    diversity panels (gwasAim), and genomic prediction via G-BLUP (gpAim).
    All three methods share a common computational engine and the same
    composite genome-wide modelling framework.
